<PolicyLayout title="Terms of Service">
  <p>VeloGroupsets is a reference site for bicycle groupsets and components. These terms apply to accounts, photo submissions and use of the service. You actively accept the current terms when signing in and separately confirm the upload licence for each photo.</p>
  <section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Your account</h2><p class="mt-3">Use your own Google account and accurate contact information. Keep your account secure, and tell us if you believe someone has used it without permission. You must be legally able to agree to these terms or have the appropriate parent or guardian’s permission. Your public display name need not be your legal name.</p></section>
  <section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Your photos and the upload licence</h2><p class="mt-3">You keep ownership of your photos. By uploading, you give the site operator a non-exclusive, worldwide, royalty-free licence to store, copy, re-encode, resize and display the photo on VeloGroupsets, and to use service providers to do those things on our behalf. The licence is for operating, maintaining and promoting the photo’s page on this service. It does not give us a general right to sell your photo, licence it for unrelated uses or train AI models on it.</p><p class="mt-3">The website’s open-source software licence does not apply to user photos. Other visitors do not receive permission to reuse your photo merely because it is publicly visible.</p><p class="mt-3">If a photo is removed, we stop new public uses under this licence. Copies may remain temporarily in caches or backups, or privately where required for an investigation or legal obligation. We cannot recall copies other people have already made.</p></section>
  <section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">What you promise when uploading</h2><p class="mt-3">You own the photo or have permission from the rights holder to grant this licence. Your submission must not infringe copyright, privacy or other rights. Get any necessary consent from identifiable people. Do not submit manufacturer images, catalogue scans or another person’s listing photos unless you have the required permission. Captions must accurately describe what the photo shows.</p></section>
  <section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Content rules and review</h2><p class="mt-3">Follow the <a class="text-link" href="/policies/community/">Community Guidelines</a>. Illegal, abusive, sexually exploitative, harassing, deceptive or irrelevant content is prohibited. We may reject, hide or remove submissions, restrict accounts or terminate access to protect the service, comply with law or enforce these terms. Uploads are reviewed before publication; submitting a photo does not guarantee publication. Contact us if you believe a decision was mistaken.</p></section>
  <section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Privacy and reports</h2><p class="mt-3">The <a class="text-link" href="/policies/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> explains account information, photo processing, reports and retention. The <a class="text-link" href="/policies/copyright/">Copyright and Takedown Policy</a> explains how to report rights infringements. Report urgent suspected illegal content by URL, without downloading or attaching it.</p></section>
  <section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Reference information and liability</h2><p class="mt-3">Specifications and community contributions can contain errors. Check the manufacturer’s instructions and use an appropriately qualified mechanic for safety-critical work. We do not guarantee the accuracy, completeness or uninterrupted availability of the service.</p><p class="mt-3">To the extent permitted by law, the service is provided as available, and we exclude liability for indirect or consequential loss arising from its use. Nothing in these terms excludes, restricts or modifies rights, guarantees or remedies that cannot lawfully be excluded, including applicable Australian Consumer Law protections. Any limitation applies only to the extent the relevant law permits it.</p></section>
  <section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Changes and ending use</h2><p class="mt-3">Material changes will be identified by a new policy version. We will require active acceptance of the current terms before further sign-in or uploads. You may stop using the service and request account closure or content removal through the contact details below. Obligations relating to earlier lawful use, disputes and legally required preservation may continue after closure.</p></section>
</PolicyLayout>
